{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 29,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 251.787,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.765,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O that I were an angel,",
      "verse": "29:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 1.945,
      "end": 4.546,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and could have the wish of mine heart,",
      "verse": "29:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 4.726,
      "end": 10.252,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might go forth and speak with the trump of God, with a voice to shake the earth,",
      "verse": "29:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.432,
      "end": 13.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cry repentance unto every people!",
      "verse": "29:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.806,
      "end": 17.893,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I would declare unto every soul, as with the voice of thunder,",
      "verse": "29:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 18.073,
      "end": 20.813,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "repentance and the plan of redemption,",
      "verse": "29:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 20.993,
      "end": 23.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should repent and come unto our God,",
      "verse": "29:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.099,
      "end": 29.579,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there might not be more sorrow upon all the face of the earth.",
      "verse": "29:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 30.259,
      "end": 33.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I am a man, and do sin in my wish;",
      "verse": "29:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 33.736,
      "end": 38.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I ought to be content with the things which the Lord hath allotted unto me.",
      "verse": "29:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 38.688,
      "end": 43.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I ought not to harrow up in my desires the firm decree of a just God,",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 43.93,
      "end": 47.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I know that he granteth unto men according to their desire,",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 47.918,
      "end": 50.379,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whether it be unto death or unto life;",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 50.559,
      "end": 53.206,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I know that he allotteth unto men,",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 53.386,
      "end": 55.801,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, decreeth unto them decrees",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 55.981,
      "end": 59.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which are unalterable, according to their wills,",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 59.319,
      "end": 62.477,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whether they be unto salvation or unto destruction.",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 63.157,
      "end": 66.594,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and I know that good and evil have come before all men;",
      "verse": "29:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 66.774,
      "end": 69.885,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he that knoweth not good from evil is blameless;",
      "verse": "29:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 70.065,
      "end": 72.387,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but he that knoweth good and evil,",
      "verse": "29:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 72.567,
      "end": 75.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to him it is given according to his desires,",
      "verse": "29:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 75.858,
      "end": 81.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whether he desireth good or evil, life or death, joy or remorse of conscience.",
      "verse": "29:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 81.879,
      "end": 85.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, seeing that I know these things, why should I desire more",
      "verse": "29:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 85.403,
      "end": 88.84,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "than to perform the work to which I have been called?",
      "verse": "29:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 89.52,
      "end": 92.074,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Why should I desire that I were an angel,",
      "verse": "29:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 92.254,
      "end": 95.319,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I could speak unto all the ends of the earth?",
      "verse": "29:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 95.999,
      "end": 102.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, the Lord doth grant unto all nations, of their own nation and tongue, to teach his word,",
      "verse": "29:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 102.588,
      "end": 106.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, in wisdom, all that he seeth fit that they should have;",
      "verse": "29:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 106.762,
      "end": 113.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore we see that the Lord doth counsel in wisdom, according to that which is just and true.",
      "verse": "29:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 113.897,
      "end": 116.73,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I know that which the Lord hath commanded me,",
      "verse": "29:9",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 116.91,
      "end": 118.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I glory in it.",
      "verse": "29:9",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 118.576,
      "end": 120.341,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I do not glory of myself,",
      "verse": "29:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 120.521,
      "end": 123.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I glory in that which the Lord hath commanded me;",
      "verse": "29:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 124.045,
      "end": 125.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and this is my glory,",
      "verse": "29:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 125.99,
      "end": 133.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that perhaps I may be an instrument in the hands of God to bring some soul to repentance; and this is my joy.",
      "verse": "29:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 133.775,
      "end": 137.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, when I see many of my brethren truly penitent,",
      "verse": "29:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 137.856,
      "end": 139.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and coming to the Lord their God,",
      "verse": "29:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 140.126,
      "end": 142.541,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then is my soul filled with joy;",
      "verse": "29:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 142.721,
      "end": 145.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then do I remember what the Lord has done for me,",
      "verse": "29:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 145.827,
      "end": 148.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even that he hath heard my prayer;",
      "verse": "29:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 148.422,
      "end": 152.88,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, then do I remember his merciful arm which he extended towards me.",
      "verse": "29:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 153.56,
      "end": 156.904,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and I also remember the captivity of my fathers;",
      "verse": "29:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 157.084,
      "end": 161.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I surely do know that the Lord did deliver them out of bondage,",
      "verse": "29:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 162.047,
      "end": 164.369,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by this did establish his church;",
      "verse": "29:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 164.549,
      "end": 171.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the Lord God, the God of Abraham, the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob, did deliver them out of bondage.",
      "verse": "29:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 172.056,
      "end": 175.911,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I have always remembered the captivity of my fathers;",
      "verse": "29:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 176.091,
      "end": 182.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that same God who delivered them out of the hands of the Egyptians did deliver them out of bondage.",
      "verse": "29:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 183.319,
      "end": 186.709,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and that same God did establish his church among them;",
      "verse": "29:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 186.889,
      "end": 193.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and that same God hath called me by a holy calling, to preach the word unto this people,",
      "verse": "29:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 193.338,
      "end": 195.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hath given me much success,",
      "verse": "29:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 195.84,
      "end": 197.744,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the which my joy is full.",
      "verse": "29:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 198.424,
      "end": 201.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I do not joy in my own success alone,",
      "verse": "29:14",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 201.344,
      "end": 205.338,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but my joy is more full because of the success of my brethren,",
      "verse": "29:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 205.518,
      "end": 208.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who have been up to the land of Nephi.",
      "verse": "29:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 208.845,
      "end": 211.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, they have labored exceedingly,",
      "verse": "29:15",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 211.533,
      "end": 213.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have brought forth much fruit;",
      "verse": "29:15",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 213.849,
      "end": 215.939,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and how great shall be their reward!",
      "verse": "29:15",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 216.619,
      "end": 220.752,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, when I think of the success of these my brethren my soul is carried away,",
      "verse": "29:16",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 220.932,
      "end": 225.855,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even to the separation of it from the body, as it were, so great is my joy.",
      "verse": "29:16",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 226.535,
      "end": 240.421,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now may God grant unto these, my brethren, that they may sit down in the kingdom of God; yea, and also all those who are the fruit of their labors",
      "verse": "29:17",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 240.601,
      "end": 242.505,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may go no more out,",
      "verse": "29:17",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 242.685,
      "end": 244.868,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that they may praise him forever.",
      "verse": "29:17",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 245.048,
      "end": 248.531,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And may God grant that it may be done according to my words,",
      "verse": "29:17",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 248.711,
      "end": 250.104,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as I have spoken.",
      "verse": "29:17",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 250.284,
      "end": 251.12,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "29:17",
      "lineIndex": 66
    }
  ]
}